# Pairs with DeleteFence. The lease half of #5631 alone: overlapping deletes
# share one lease, so the first to end lets a publish of the id in while the
# other is still deleting.
MODULE: DeleteFenceEndClearsEveryLease
TARGET: DeleteFence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: one delete ending drops every delete's lease
PERTURBS: DelEnd

--- FIND
    /\ lease' = [lease EXCEPT ![d] = "none"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<row, pend, held, cap, ret, art, gen, dgen>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the end drops every lease of the id, not its own.
    /\ lease' = [e \in Dels |-> "none"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<row, pend, held, cap, ret, art, gen, dgen>>
--- END
